  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-UN Dialogue on Digital Transformation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Design and facilitation of a half-day workshop with Ambassador of EU Member States and heads of United Nations Country Team with the aim&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;To set a baseline/context on what is digital transformation, consider some examples of successful digital transformation initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;To visualize a digitally-transformed society in VN, what are the benefits and risks of such a change&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Consultant is expected to provide the following deliverables:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;before the workshop: design of the workshop including agenda and guidance note for participants&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;during the workshop: facilitation and moderation of interactive discussions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;after the workshop: &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;develop a document with &apos;Guiding Principles of Digital Transformation in Viet Nam&apos;, which will outline priority areas, red lines, and some general common messaging on the EU-UN support to digital transformation in VN.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
